  <prompt>Only if task 010 recorded "go": replace design-to-spec Step 3's "quick Grep/Glob" exception with one code-mapper reuse scan, define the notes/reuse-scan.md contract, route 2+ candidates to Step 5 and Owner Clarifications, and rewrite the two lines that forbid comprehensive discovery.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer maintaining AI procedure files.</role>
  <goal>design-to-spec SKILL.md runs one scan in Step 3, writes notes/reuse-scan.md at Step 4, raises 2+ candidates in Step 5, and its Constraints line (~40) and Step 3 scope limitation (~162) say this scan is the single allowed discovery pass.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>spec.md FR-04; design.md sections 4.0, 4.1, 4.2. Plan Mode is read-only, so the scan runs during Step 3 and the file is written when Step 4 starts writing. Use the effort recorded by task 010 (low unless the owner approved medium).</background>
