  <completion-notes>Completed 2026-11-12. Precondition met: task 010 go (owner, 2026-11-12), effort low. design-to-spec SKILL.md: Step 3 adds the reuse scan (one code-mapper agent, model sonnet, effort low from the definition, design.md 4.1 schema, index first, excludes projects/ and .claude/worktrees/), the orchestrator judges, result held for Step 4; Step 4 writes notes/reuse-scan.md (per capability searches, candidates, verdict; plan-level duplication check; model/effort/tokens); Step 5 asks the 2+ candidate questions and records them under Owner Clarifications; Constraints line and Step 3 scope limitation rewritten; gotcha, success criteria and stamps updated. spec-template: section 11 overlap column and Owner Clarifications point at reuse-scan.md, no new heading. No heading or step number changed; code-mapper.md unchanged; 246 to 277 lines (cap 500). Citation grep: project-pipeline SKILL.md:136 described design-to-spec Step 3 as ADR-only; corrected here (one clause). Skill-length guard 0 new; Test-InstructionPaths 0 new. CHANGELOG entry added. Step 9.5 not run: STANDARD, documentation-only. rework: none task 011</completion-notes>

